{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25549","headline":"咏古 · 李涉","name":"咏古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大智思济物，道行心始休。\n垂纶自消息，岁月任春秋。\n纣虐武既贤，风云固可求。\n顺天行杀机，所向协良谋。\n况以丈人师，将济安川流。\n何劳问枯骨，再取阴阳筹。\n霸国不务仁，兵戈恣相酬。\n空令渭水迹，千古独悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}